WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.006 --> 00:00:21.715
After Cooking class Ben met Waldo and his other friends in the hallway to discuss Winnie's surprise party.

2
00:00:21.716 --> 00:00:25.761
"Mog and I will handle the decorations," Deb said.

3
00:00:25.762 --> 00:00:33.962
Mog grinned. "Wait until you see what Deb can do with spider webs. She's a true artist!"

4
00:00:33.963 --> 00:00:41.238
"I'm going to make a batch of newt punch," a witch said. "It's Winnie's favorite."

5
00:00:41.239 --> 00:00:44.751
Ben didn't say much during the meeting.

6
00:00:44.752 --> 00:00:53.347
His mind was on his two problems—the cooking competition and Winnie's birthday gift.

7
00:00:53.348 --> 00:01:00.443
When everyone headed back to class, he grabbed Waldo. "I need your help."

8
00:01:00.444 --> 00:01:02.917
"What's wrong?" Waldo asked.

9
00:01:02.918 --> 00:01:09.323
Ben leaned in closer. "I don't want to be on Kids' Kitchen Showdown."

10
00:01:09.324 --> 00:01:16.092
"Are you kidding?" Waldo's glasses slid down his nose.

11
00:01:16.093 --> 00:01:19.922
"Most monsters would love to be on that show!"

12
00:01:19.923 --> 00:01:22.439
"Not me."

13
00:01:22.440 --> 00:01:26.095
Waldo scratched the side of his head.

14
00:01:26.096 --> 00:01:32.446
"I'll come up with some ideas. Meet me in the cooking classroom after school."

15
00:01:32.447 --> 00:01:36.093
Ben hardly heard anything in history class that morning.

16
00:01:36.094 --> 00:01:43.724
As Mrs. Flump droned on about the Monster Stamp Act of 1839, Ben thought about Kids' Kitchen Showdown.

17
00:01:43.725 --> 00:01:48.154
He couldn't wait to hear Waldo's ideas.

18
00:01:48.155 --> 00:01:53.051
The wizard's spells usually went wrong, but Ben was getting desperate.

19
00:01:53.052 --> 00:01:57.228
Besides, maybe Waldo wouldn't even have to use magic.

20
00:01:57.229 --> 00:02:00.717
"Soon I'll be free!" Ben thought gleefully.

21
00:02:00.718 --> 00:02:05.425
Winnie sat nearby. "What are you smiling about?" she whispered.

22
00:02:05.426 --> 00:02:11.276
"Huh?" Ben hadn't realized he'd been smiling. "Oh, nothing."

23
00:02:11.277 --> 00:02:16.842
Winnie gave him a suspicious look.

24
00:02:16.843 --> 00:02:22.056
"You must be thinking about the perfect birthday present you got for me."

25
00:02:22.057 --> 00:02:27.199
"What present?" Ben said. "I didn't get you—I mean . . ."

26
00:02:27.200 --> 00:02:35.995
"Relax," Winnie teased him. "I'm just kidding."

27
00:02:35.996 --> 00:02:43.286
After school Ben rushed into the cooking classroom and found Waldo waiting for him.

28
00:02:43.287 --> 00:02:46.006
"Did you think of anything?" Ben asked.

29
00:02:46.007 --> 00:02:52.978
"I sure did!" Waldo beamed. "Hot sauce!"

30
00:02:52.979 --> 00:02:55.483
"Huh? Hot sauce?"

31
00:02:55.484 --> 00:02:58.619
"Not just any hot sauce," Waldo said.

32
00:02:58.620 --> 00:03:05.461
"Monster hot sauce. Your food will be so spicy, Mr. Icky will get nervous.

33
00:03:05.462 --> 00:03:12.425
He'll decide that it's much too hot for the humans and pull you from the competition."

34
00:03:12.426 --> 00:03:18.504
"Hmm," Ben said slowly. "I guess that might work."

35
00:03:18.505 --> 00:03:24.857
"Mr. Icky is gone for the day—let's make some hot sauce right now!"

36
00:03:24.858 --> 00:03:31.704
While Waldo searched the pantry for spicy ingredients, Ben set a pot on the stove.

37
00:03:31.705 --> 00:03:36.255
He was chopping slugs when Waldo came back from the pantry.

38
00:03:36.256 --> 00:03:40.783
The wizard placed a bunch of jars and bottles on the counter.

39
00:03:40.784 --> 00:03:47.215
Most of the labels showed flames. A couple had skulls and crossbones.

40
00:03:47.216 --> 00:03:49.170
Waldo unscrewed a cap.

41
00:03:49.171 --> 00:03:53.687
A wisp of smoke drifted from the bottle.

42
00:03:53.688 --> 00:03:59.642
"This is concentrated volcano smoke," he said, pouring it into the pot.

43
00:03:59.643 --> 00:04:03.639
Poof! A cloud of smoke billowed from the pot.

44
00:04:03.640 --> 00:04:06.909
The sauce bubbled violently.

45
00:04:06.910 --> 00:04:10.130
Ben and Waldo looked at each other and smiled.

46
00:04:10.131 --> 00:04:13.672
Waldo picked up another bottle and examined the label.

47
00:04:13.673 --> 00:04:17.100
"I'm not sure what this is. It's in another language.

48
00:04:17.101 --> 00:04:20.496
But it does show flames."

49
00:04:20.497 --> 00:04:23.586
He poured it in.

50
00:04:23.587 --> 00:04:27.312
Bubbles formed on the surface of the hot sauce.

51
00:04:27.313 --> 00:04:31.851
They popped, sending orange vapors into the air.

52
00:04:31.852 --> 00:04:35.662
Ben dipped a spoon into the sauce and tasted it.

53
00:04:35.663 --> 00:04:40.634
His hair stood straight up. "Whoa!" he cried.

54
00:04:40.635 --> 00:04:45.452
Waldo tasted it. His hair stood up too.

55
00:04:45.453 --> 00:04:48.491
"Do you think it's done?" Ben asked.

56
00:04:48.492 --> 00:04:51.439
"Nah." Waldo pushed his glasses up.

57
00:04:51.440 --> 00:04:55.315
"We're just getting started!"

58
00:04:55.316 --> 00:05:00.092
He popped open a small jar and sprinkled in some small red crystals.

59
00:05:00.093 --> 00:05:03.765
Fwoomf! A giant flame leaped from the pot.

60
00:05:03.766 --> 00:05:06.050
Ben and Waldo jumped backward.

61
00:05:06.051 --> 00:05:11.068
When the flame went down, Ben dipped his spoon into the pot.

62
00:05:11.069 --> 00:05:14.573
"Yikes! My spoon melted!"

63
00:05:14.574 --> 00:05:18.278
"The recipe is working."

64
00:05:18.279 --> 00:05:23.090
Waldo emptied a few more bottles into the pot.

65
00:05:23.091 --> 00:05:26.679
Then he opened a large jar.

66
00:05:26.680 --> 00:05:29.180
"What's that?" Ben asked.

67
00:05:29.181 --> 00:05:41.550
"It's pure lava." Waldo measured out two cups of the lava.

68
00:05:41.551 --> 00:05:47.384
Red steam filled the air, fogging up Waldo's glasses.

69
00:05:47.385 --> 00:05:50.787
He took them off and placed them on the counter.

70
00:05:50.788 --> 00:05:54.961
Waldo and Ben let the hot sauce simmer for a few minutes.

71
00:05:54.962 --> 00:05:59.346
Then Waldo leaned over and sniffed.

72
00:05:59.347 --> 00:06:07.111
Instantly his nose turned bright red and his eyes began to water.

73
00:06:07.112 --> 00:06:12.687
"Let me taste it." Ben skimmed the surface with his spoon.

74
00:06:12.688 --> 00:06:15.828
He brought it to his lips and took a sip.

75
00:06:15.829 --> 00:06:19.434
He felt a rush of heat flow through his body.

76
00:06:19.435 --> 00:06:23.143
Looking down, he saw that he'd turned completely red!

77
00:06:23.144 --> 00:06:28.271
"Wow!" he said. "Waldo, I think the sauce is done!"

78
00:06:28.272 --> 00:06:31.789
"I have one more thing to add."

79
00:06:31.790 --> 00:06:36.994
Waldo ran to the pantry and came back with another small jar.

80
00:06:36.995 --> 00:06:39.247
"I'm going to put in a teaspoon of this stuff.

81
00:06:39.248 --> 00:06:44.690
It's called enhancer. It'll enhance all the flavors."

82
00:06:44.691 --> 00:06:52.267
He unscrewed the lid, scooped out some enhancer, and dropped it into the hot sauce.

83
00:06:52.268 --> 00:06:56.237
The pot began to shake as the sauce bubbled fiercely.

84
00:06:56.238 --> 00:07:05.524
Ben gasped as hot sauce erupted from the pot!
